    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112745" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠτ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>planting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				7.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.433.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				19.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>generation, production,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Thg.</u>
				121c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>growth, habit of a plant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>plantation</i> or simply <i>a plant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Moschio
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.207d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				15.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				606.7
			</span></i> (Abila, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>).</div>
